            "block_content": "<table><tr><td>Dynamic_SEReqControlMode</td><td>complexType:Dynamic_SEReqControlModeTyperefer to 8.3.5.3.13</td><td>This element is used by the EVCC for initiating settings for the dynamic control mode.</td></tr><tr><td>Scheduled_SEReqControlMode</td><td>complexType:Scheduled_SEReqControlModeTyperefer to 8.3.5.3.14</td><td>This element is used by the EVCC for initiating settings for the scheduled control mode.</td></tr></table>",
