        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "[V2G20-1201] If more than one ScheduleTuple containing PriceLevelSchedule is sent to the EV, they shall have the same NumberOfPriceLevels and priceLevels inside. Different ScheduleTupleless shall correspond to the same energy price level.",
