                    133.0,
                    1062.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "NOTE 1 By \"cost\", the EVSE can stimulate - not force - the EV to transfer energy in periods where it is advantageous for the grid (e.g. because in these periods, a lot of wind-power is to be expected).",
